{"info": {"address1": "GIFT Two Building", "address2": "28th Floor Block No. 56 Road - 5C, Zone - 5, GIFT CITY", "city": "Gandhinagar", "zip": "382355", "country": "India", "phone": "91 79 6777 2204", "fax": "91 79 6777 2205", "website": "https://www.avenuesai.com", "industry": "Software - Infrastructure", "industryKey": "software-infrastructure", "industryDisp": "Software - Infrastructure", "sector": "Technology", "sectorKey": "technology", "sectorDisp": "Technology", "longBusinessSummary": "AvenuesAI Limited engages in the provision of digital payment solutions and enterprise software platforms for merchants, enterprises, governments and banks. The company operates through Payment Business and E-Commerce Platform Business segments. It also offers CCAvenue, a payment gateway that enables merchants to easily and securely accept a wide range of digital payment methods, as well as payment gateway related solutions, including B2Biz payments, CCAvenue SNIP, CCAvenue TokenPay, CCAvenue F.R.I.S.K, CCAvenue TokenPay, and invoice payment and subscription solutions. In addition, the company provides BillAvenue, a unified and interoperable platform that enables seamless utility and recurring payments; ResAvenue, an online hospitality management solution that helps hoteliers to distribute room inventory; Go Payments, an online platform that offers domestic money transfer, AEPS, mobile recharge, travel bookings, and other financial services for consumers; and TrustAvenue, a lending platform that provide working capital loans, invoice/bill discounting, and early settlement to digital payment merchants and banks. Further, the company provides BuildaBazaar for Enterprise, a cloud based end-to-end software as a service eCommerce marketplace technology platform that allows corporates to transact online, manage the back end, make digital payments, undertake online marketing, and other value-added digital services. It operates in India, the United Arab Emirates, and internationally. The company was formerly known as Infibeam Avenues Limited and changed its name to AvenuesAI Limited in January 2026. AvenuesAI Limited was founded in 2001 and is headquartered in Gandhinagar, India.", "fullTimeEmployees": 764, "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Vishal Ajitbhai Mehta", "age": 51, "title": "Chairman & MD", "yearBorn": 1974, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Vishwas Ambalal Patel", "age": 56, "title": "CEO, MD & Director", "yearBorn": 1969, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sunil N. Bhagat", "age": 52, "title": "Chief Financial Officer", "yearBorn": 1973, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Parag  Raval", "age": 73, "title": "Chief Administrative Officer", "yearBorn": 1952, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Shyamal Bhaskerbhai Trivedi", "age": 46, "title": "Senior VP, Chief Compliance Officer, Company Secretary & KMP", "yearBorn": 1979, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 3300000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. K.S. Ramya Murthy", "title": "Head of Human Resource", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Vijayakumar Subrakumar Subramanian", "age": 47, "title": "Chief Executive Officer of Platform Business", "yearBorn": 1978, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Vivek  Nayak", "title": "Group Chief Operating Officer of Payments Services Division", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Pankaj  Dedhia", "title": "Chief Business Officer of India Payments Services Division", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ankit  Patel", "title": "Group Chief Technology Officer & Ind